class="megamenu_level1" href="/how-do-i/find-job-opportunities-with-johnson-county" aria-label="Find Job Opportunities with Johnson County" data-navid="310" target="_self" >Find Job Opportunities with Johnson County</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/how-do-i/obtain-a-certified-copy-of-a-birth-record" aria-label="Obtain a certified copy of a Birth Record" data-navid="569" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Obtain a certified copy of a Birth Record</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/how-do-i/obtain-a-certified-copy-of-a-death-record" aria-label="Obtain a certified copy of a Death Record" data-navid="570" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Obtain a certified copy of a Death Record</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/how-do-i/pay-my" aria-label="Pay My..." data-navid="309" target="_self" >Pay My...</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/how-do-i/submit-photos-to-this-website" aria-label="Submit Photos to this Website" data-navid="308" target="_self" >Submit Photos to this Website</a></li></ul></div></div></li></ul><script>
